WEBVTT

NOTE A steady-paced pool drill. English captions; text is the exact narration script.

1
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.468
A swimmer begins six meters from the wall.

2
00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:09.982
In this short drill, assume
a steady pace until arrival.

3
00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:17.770
After four seconds, three meters remain.

4
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:24.281
Notice what changed: time increased,
while distance remaining decreased.

5
00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:28.054
Use those two observations
to predict the arrival time.

6
00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:31.289
Keep your prediction; the
graph will help you check it.
